  "comments": "<p>Varieties exist.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - the date 29 · XI · 1943 on ribbon is situated in center.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - the date 29 · XI · 1943 has double impression: the first one is at the lower part of the ribbon, the second is situated in center, being the first impression clearly visible. As the result the interpuncts look like colons.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ed7fbada8b24.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ed7fbada8b24.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong>: 1971-1981.<br>Die <strong>2</strong>: 1979,1980</p>",
